      "hint": "两个冰球质量相同，所以分离角为 $90^\\circ$，第二个冰球以 $\\theta_2 = 30.0^\\circ - 90^\\circ$ 离开。然后，沿 $y$ 轴的动量守恒把两个末速率联系起来。"
     },
     {
      "part": "(a) direction below the x-axis",
      "value": 60.0,
      "unit": "°"
     }
    ],
    "solution": "（a）3.00 m/s，在 $x$ 轴下方 $60^\\circ$。（b）求碰撞后第一个冰球的速率：$0 = m{v'}_1\\sin 30^\\circ - m{v'}_2\\sin 60^\\circ$，所以 ${v'}_1 = {v'}_2\\frac{\\sin 60^\\circ}{\\sin 30^\\circ} = 5.196\\ \\text{m/s}$。验证初动能与末动能之比等于 1：$\\text{KE} = \\tfrac{1}{2}m{v_1}^2 = 18m\\ \\text{J}$，而 $\\text{KE}' = \\tfrac{1}{2}m{{v'}_1}^2 + \\tfrac{1}{2}m{{v'}_2}^2 = 18m\\ \\text{J}$，所以 $\\text{KE}/\\text{KE}' = 1.00$。"
   }
