    "solution": "已知 $m_1 = m_2 \\equiv m$。于是，给定的方程变为 $\\kvone = \\kvone\\cos\\theta_1 + \\kvtwo\\cos\\theta_2$ 和 $0 = \\kvoneprime\\sin\\theta_1 + \\kvtwoprime\\sin\\theta_2$。把每个方程两边平方，得到 ${\\kvone}^2 = {\\kvoneprime}^2\\cos^2\\theta_1 + {\\kvtwoprime}^2\\cos^2\\theta_2 + 2\\kvoneprime\\kvtwoprime\\cos\\theta_1\\cos\\theta_2$ 和 $0 = {\\kvoneprime}^2\\sin^2\\theta_1 + {\\kvtwoprime}^2\\sin^2\\theta_2 + 2\\kvoneprime\\kvtwoprime\\sin\\theta_1\\sin\\theta_2$。把这两个方程相加并化简：${\\kvone}^2 = {\\kvoneprime}^2 + {\\kvtwoprime}^2 + 2\\kvoneprime\\kvtwoprime(\\cos\\theta_1\\cos\\theta_2 + \\sin\\theta_1\\sin\\theta_2)$，即 ${\\kvone}^2 = {\\kvoneprime}^2 + {\\kvtwoprime}^2 + 2\\kvoneprime\\kvtwoprime\\left(\\tfrac{1}{2}\\cos(\\theta_1 - \\theta_2) + \\tfrac{1}{2}\\cos(\\theta_1 + \\theta_2) + \\tfrac{1}{2}\\cos(\\theta_1 - \\theta_2) - \\tfrac{1}{2}\\cos(\\theta_1 + \\theta_2)\\right)$，于是 ${\\kvone}^2 = {\\kvoneprime}^2 + {\\kvtwoprime}^2 + 2\\kvoneprime\\kvtwoprime\\cos(\\theta_1 - \\theta_2)$。把整个方程乘以 $\\tfrac{1}{2}m$，就恢复出动能：$\\tfrac{1}{2}m{\\kvone}^2 = \\tfrac{1}{2}m{\\kvoneprime}^2 + \\tfrac{1}{2}m{\\kvtwoprime}^2 + m\\kvoneprime\\kvtwoprime\\cos(\\theta_1 - \\theta_2)$。"
